  <service verb="import" noun="Mbox" authenticate="anonymous-all" allow-remote="false">
    <description>Operation importMbox: a mailing list's archive, an mbox file the operator put in the import directory
      (archiveName, with its SHA-256 as checksum), is imported into a category by the list's owners (the site's owners and
      operators, the category's staff, an Owner of the group or repository it is bound to) as a checkpointed run: messages
      become topics and posts with their dates, threaded by Message-ID, In-Reply-To and References, and by subject for a
      "Re:" with no parent in the archive. text/plain is taken before text/html (cleaned), format=flowed and encoded words
      are read, files are left out and counted. An author is a profile with no account, by the hash of the address (the
      address is not stored); an account that verifies the address gets the posts (claim#VerifiedAddress). The same
      archive into the same category again adds nothing. Sends no mail.</description>
    <in-parameters><parameter name="input" type="Map"/></in-parameters>
    <out-parameters><parameter name="result" type="Map"/></out-parameters>
    <actions>
      <script>result=ec.resource.script('component://mr-mantle/service/mantle/forum/Forum.js').execute('importMbox',input || {})</script>
    </actions>
  </service>
  <service verb="get" noun="MboxImport" authenticate="anonymous-all" allow-remote="false">
    <description>Operation getMboxImport: an mbox import's stage (importing, imported, failed), its run and its report: what
